opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis:
  "Native OCaml Zerobus Ingest SDK — OTLP (OpenTelemetry) exporter (Async)"
description: """
The Async instantiation of the optional OTLP interface (DESIGN §4.3): the
counterpart of zerobus-otlp (Lwt). An otlp/grpc LogsService / MetricsService
exporter over the Async H2 transport (reuses zerobus-async), sharing the
vendored OpenTelemetry collector protos (zerobus-otlp.proto) and zerobus-async's
pure-ocaml-tls token backend (no cohttp-async/OpenSSL)."""
